Subject: [PATCH] Verify token configuration and registry handover transitions
Base: components/ccip @ 501bdc31118a16de859985a4ee7cce906edd588f

WHY: Verify script-2 registration and DAO CCIP administration, script-3 authority
preconditions, legacy flows, acceptance between scripts, and idempotent retries.
Keep the full-flow assertions aligned with each script's responsibilities.
This patch touches tests only and changes no deployment code.

